This ontology fragment defines classes for `UserGroup`, `User`, `Job`, and `Privilege`. It also defines object properties for `hasUserGroupAdmin`, `isMemberGroup`, `hasStrictUGControl`, `hasPrivileges`, `canControlJob`, `canResumeStoppedJob`, and `inheritsRights`. Additionally, it defines a datatype property for `hasUserGroupAdminRights` and `hasPrivileges`. The properties have their domains and ranges defined as well.
